---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact & Marketplace Request — LabelCropNow"
  description="Contact the LabelCropNow engineering team, report courier layout updates, or request support for new marketplace formats."
  canonicalPath="/contact"
>
  <div class="container static-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="badge badge-amber">Feedback & Support</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">Contact & Marketplace Requests</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Have a suggestion or need support for a new courier or marketplace format? We would love to hear from you.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="content-body card">
      <h2>Request a New Courier or Marketplace Preset</h2>
      <p>
        Did your marketplace recently change its PDF dispatch slip layout, or do you need custom crop margins for a regional carrier not currently listed in our directory?
      </p>
      <p>
        LabelCropNow is actively maintained. You can reach out directly via:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@labelcropnow.pages.dev">support@labelcropnow.pages.dev</a></li>
        <li><strong>Community & Source:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/labelcropnow" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/labelcropnow</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Reporting Scanner Issues</h2>
      <p>
        If an optical barcode scanner at your courier hub has trouble reading a cropped thermal label, please let us know the printer model (e.g. Rollo, Zebra ZD420) and carrier name so we can fine-tune vector boundary offsets.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .static-page {
    padding: 3.5rem 1.25rem 5rem;
    max-width: 850px;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .content-body {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    color: #334155;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .content-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .content-body h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .content-body p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .content-body ul {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .content-body li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
